# Drop zone for raw Search Console exports — not the record.
#
# The committed artifact is the normalised snapshot under growth/data/gsc/,
# which is what every script reads. These CSVs are overwritten by next week's
# export, so tracking them would churn the same paths every cycle while adding
# nothing that data/gsc/ does not already hold in a queryable form.
#
# The export also carries dimensions we deliberately do not publish through the
# repo (country breakdowns), and this directory is served by Cloudflare Pages
# unless blocked — it is, in functions/_middleware.js, but not tracking the
# files removes the question entirely.
*.csv
*.tsv
*.zip
!.gitkeep
